# Purpose
Helps users create clear file names with dates, versions, status labels, and
consistent separators.

# Key Sections
- Good file names.
- What to include.
- Dates.
- Versions.
- Status labels.
- Separators.

# Dependencies
- Belongs to the productivity manual set.

# Gotchas
- Keep examples neutral and avoid exposing customer names or private project
  names.

